      "message": "fix(verify): list plasma law warnings as findings and op warnings\n\nThe plasma laws judged the program and found tip-up and kerf-crossing\nwarnings, but verify showed them only inside the gate.not_judged\nsentence. findings, the operation warnings and ok read clean.\n\nThe plasma clause now keeps each warning as a posting::GateWarning\n(op, kind, message). GateReport carries them. cam.verify adds each one\nto its operation's warnings row and to gate.warnings. MCP verify lists\neach one in findings (kind plasma_tip_up or plasma_kerf_crossing,\nblocks_post false). The laws warn, so ok and held_by do not change.\n\nFixes #3456\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
